      "section_path": [
        "Sick Leave Reporting Guide",
        "Report an absence promptly"
      ],
      "text": "Use My time > Absence > Report sickness before the scheduled shift starts whenever reasonably possible. If illness prevents portal access, notify the manager through the established absence channel and ask HR to record the report. A notification is not a requirement to disclose a diagnosis to a manager. The portal accepts an initial open-ended report; add an expected return date when it becomes known.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
