      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Sick Leave Reporting Guide",
        "On return to work"
      ],
      "text": "Select Confirm return on the first day back and review the charged scheduled days. If the expected end date changed, update it before confirming. ABS-413 means an attachment exceeds 10 MB; ABS-415 means the file is not PDF, PNG, or JPEG. Replace an unreadable file rather than adding repeated copies. Keep the clinical note in the confidential attachment field; the absence timeline only needs the dates and evidence status.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
